Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A large amount of debris is scattered around the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Many people seem to be involved, and active rescue operations are underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you were caught up in such an incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad both of you are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was dangerous, but Win and the others saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsukumoya-san, I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. \NBut don't push yourself too hard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I guess I'll head over to Miyai-kun's hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'll go too—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just me is fine. \NHe doesn't seem to have any major injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I see his face and confirm he's fine, I'll contact you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun, take care of Niika-chan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Take care of her,"{\i0} she says... You're doing just fine, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Take care of her",{\i0} huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kirifuda Win...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on Lost! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was just lost in thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving me earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem, I'm just glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right, Win-kun. \NHere, you forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Crystal Card that Murasaki had...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.84,0:01:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who won Win-kun, \Nso it's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. \NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Lost, you're gathering Crystal Cards too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to restore it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This world that took away my mother. \NMy only family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it a bit too salty?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! \NIt's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the ocean again today, \Nso please handle dinner too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The waves are great today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Besides, I have the charm Lost gave me, \Nso I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a careless mother, but she was kind and always loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But on that day, the world suddenly went mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this... Mom's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can return this world to how it was... \NMom will...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any family in this world either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's restore this world back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If the two of us cooperate, \Ngathering the Crystal Cards will be easier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost... But does it really hold that kind of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the full details. \NI just heard it's connected to the Holy War.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy War? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you got involved with the Crystal Cards, you've been in danger nonstop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, ever since I got the Crystal Card, \NI didn't know how to use it or what it could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But just as Lost said, \Nif we can really bring this world back...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Win...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. \NCome on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Items related to the Holy War...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jashin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The cause that distorted this world, and \Nthe tragedy that swallowed him, all lead back to the Holy War.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play games with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared for whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheeky brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Key to the Holy War...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the one who gathers them all \Nshall be granted that qualification.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This world began because of {\i1}him{\i0} as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Master of Duel... or so he calls himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Master of Duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As usual, you only focus on what's right in front of you, \Nblind to the bigger picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There can be only one victor in the Holy War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Discard unnecessary affection. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who indulge in cozy "cooperation" \Nhave no right to alter the principles of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Win, do you have work today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No... What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da! Strategy meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we have a 3-day weekend starting tomorrow, right? \NI thought it'd be nice to go somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't had a proper vacation lately at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the mountains? Somewhere full of nature! \NHow about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lost Field is constantly expanding. \NNiika, you know there's no "safe place" in this world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go somewhere even further away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean... \NOh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tsukumoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs16\c&H00D09B2B&\frz342.1\pos(200.533,127.289)}Tsukumoya-san
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b0\fs12\c&H00FFFFFF&\frz342.2\pos(187.2,163.556)\i1}Win-kun, do you have time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager's condition seems to have worsened...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll understand once you see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a Lost Field, right? \NI can't believe it grew this much...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Only that specific part was torn open. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I wanted to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered if something might \Nbe happening around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Around Nasu Highlands, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are other places where \NLost Fields haven't reached yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,True, there's no absolute proof. \NBut look, this spot is completely clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we haven't found any other location fitting these same conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your side, Win-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you figure out anything since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Master of Duel."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jashin mentioned it yesterday. \NHe said this twisted world was created by someone called Master of Duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Master of Duel...? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Meguru! Meguru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call a nurse! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Meguru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:10:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Meguru!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, he seems to have calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, it's my fault—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, Win-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, that "Master of Duel" you mentioned...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,, I see, so Jashin said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.36,0:11:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go check out Nasu Highlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What Tsukumoya-san said caught my attention too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he was trying to tell us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasu Highlands... \NWe definitely have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What, were you planning on leaving me behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? You're coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to help Win-kun, alright? \NBut don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Meguru's condition too, \Nso I'll investigate Master of Duel on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If I find anything, I'll contact you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Win?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Got it. \NWell then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Win! It's the mountains! Mountains! \NNature is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't come here to play around, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But since we came all this way, \Nwe have to make tons of memories! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Milk gelato, shakes, seeing cows at the ranch, \Nand the observatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! They say this place is called Lover's Sanctuary! \NShould we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Win-kun. \NA little bit of sightseeing couldn't hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:12:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, even you, Lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how Win-kun feels, \Nbut rushing won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it turned out convenient for me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only ever exchanged emails \Nand never met in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We met online, but before I knew it, \Nwe started sharing our troubles with each other. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I didn't have any friends before...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I could meet them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome! Let's go meet them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they around our age? \NWhat will you do if you meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Play Duel Masters? \NI'll lend you my deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyai-kun, do you know anything about "Master of Duel"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Yeah, thought so. \NThanks anyway. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's no good after all. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bolmeteus doesn't know either, \Nand going to the police would just get me turned away...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jashin said that this crazy world was made \Nby someone named Master of Duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that guy is the cause, \Ncould it be related to Dad's incident too?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice view! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My throat's dry, i will buy a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,is your friend doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... They haven't replied at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look like that! \NYou can just try another day!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm sure they're just busy right now, \Nso a reply will come eventually!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. \NWhat drinks do you two want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a milk shake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Win doesn't look like he's enjoying himself at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Win...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wander off on your own again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Win... Do you hate this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's a nice world. \NThere are such beautiful places here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't the two of us just run away \Nsomewhere really far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A place with no Creatures, where nobody knows us... Somewhere far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you yesterday, there's no place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we run far away, reality will catch up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even here, tomorrow—no, even right now, we don't know what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Creatures could attack at any moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish "right now" could last forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me once before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"If you're having fun right now, \Nthat's what matters most."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I value right now, \Nbut I want to cherish the future too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's what moving forward really means.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we end up getting hurt a lot more...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I... don't want to see Win get hurt anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, I feel like one day... \NWin won't be Win anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you promise to never forget me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you saying? \NOf course I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I stop being myself and forget all about Win?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that would happen! What if it were the other way around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the way! \NGet out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will always be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun, Niika-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Win! Lily of the valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the wind feels so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What an unpleasant wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...? \NSomething feels wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Win... I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run, Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guess we have no choice...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.37,0:19:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.36,0:19:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people aren't enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need to treat her! \NHurry, to my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave her medicine brewed from Reishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Reishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a type of mushroom. \NIt has detoxifying properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, you really know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It also has the power to counter darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go. After a little rest, \Nshe'll get better in no time. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had noticed sooner... \NI'm sorry, Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Thank you for stopping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was you. We finally meet. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Err... nice to meet you, \NI'm Moriguchi Hiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept messaging me, \Nbut I was tied up with farm work and couldn't step away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is Win-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That child told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:20:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That child? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that attacked-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's protecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the protection of the Guardian Deity, this area hasn't been swallowed by Miasma. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, long ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That map... It was protecting this place? {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.37,0:21:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what it meant?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it's true that I put Niika-san in danger. \NI'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was the one who jumped to conclusions...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did all this happen so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head to the field. \NWhen Niika-san wakes up, she'll probably be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go prepare food!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we could meet, Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Win-kun, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off! \NOh, Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to pick me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.09,0:22:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Pick you up"? \NWhat does she mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.68,0:22:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll understand in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.12,0:22:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply breaking the barrier... \Nwill not purge my darkness!
